---
description: Strict Godot 4.7 GDScript 2.0 typing, API, and UID sidecar rules
globs: "**/*.gd"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Enforce strict static typing on all variables, parameters, and return types (`-> void`).
- Reject legacy Godot 3 syntax (`Spatial`, `KinematicBody3D`, `yield`, `export var`, `onready var`).
- Pushable puzzle blocks use kinematic `CharacterBody3D` / `AnimatableBody3D`, never unconstrained `RigidBody3D`.
- Move `.gd` and `.gd.uid` sidecar pairs together atomically with `git mv`.
